\par\par \b \uc2  S'pore MAS says profits cut by  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2  - paper. \b0\par\par\uc2 211 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 29 Juni 1995\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1995 Reuters Limited\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 SINGAPORE\b0 \highlight\uc2 , June 29 (Reuter) - The \b \highlight22\uc2 Monetary Authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  of \b \highlight22\uc2 Singapore\b0 \highlight\uc2  (MAS) reported a sharply lower profit in 1994 as a result of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  to check the \b \highlight22\uc2 Singapore\b0 \highlight\uc2  dollar's rise, the Straits Times said, quoting an MAS spokesman. \par \par \uc2  The paper said the strong local dollar had also led to a depreciation in the value of MAS foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves. MAS made a profit of Singapore $288.20 million in 1994 against S$1.13 billion in the previous year after providing for contingencies. \par \par \uc2  The paper added the lower profit arose from the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by \b \highlight22\uc2 Singapore\b0 \highlight\uc2 's de facto \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  In addition, the value of MAS's U.S. dollar-denominated reserves declined over the year when they were converted back into Singapore dollars. \par \par \uc2  Last year, the Singapore dollar rose by about 10 percent against the greenback. \par \par \uc2  The paper, quoting the spokesman, said that given Singapore's strong balance of payment surplus and huge inflows of capital, the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  would have risen even more against the U.S. dollar were it not for MAS \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  "But the official made it clear the level of trading would not be a constraint on MAS monetary policy," the paper said. \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1995 \par \p