\par\par \b \uc2  Singapore: Govt Will Continue To Support U.S. Dlr - Report \b0\par\par\uc2 222 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 17 April 1995\par 03:05\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1995, Dow Jones & Co., Inc.) \par \par \uc2  SINGAPORE (AP-DJ)--The \b \highlight22\uc2 Monetary Authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  of \b \highlight22\uc2 Singapore\b0 \highlight\uc2  (MAS) will continue to pursue active \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in stemming the rapid rise of the \b \highlight22\uc2 Singapore\b0 \highlight\uc2  dollar against the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , said Finance Minister Richard Hu, according to a Monday Business Times report. The U.S. dollar has recently been sliding against major foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  But to maintain Singapore's reputation as a financial center, Hu reportedly said MAS, the island-state's de facto \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , will only use negative interest rates and \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  controls as last resort to drive away short-term funds seeking refuge in the strong Singapore dollar. \par \par \uc2  Hu also said in the report the Singapore dollar's appreciation has yet to reach a critical point to draw drastic action from the MAS. 'This is an unusual period because of the yen, but we don't expect the appreciation to continue indefinitely. The main impact isn't on the U.S, it's a Japanese problem,' Hu was quoted as saying, in observation of the weak U.S. dollar against the Japanese yen. \par \par \uc2  Hu added the Japanese 'will have to do something before we (Singapore) need to do something because it is hurting them more than it is hurting us.' \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 16-04-95 \par \par \uc2  0105GMT \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011025dr4h02rl6\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
